    {
      "source": "To make it work, you need to add the <code>@EnableCaching</code> annotation and configure the <code>cacheManager</code> bean:",
      "translation": "要使该功能生效，您需要添加<code>@EnableCaching</code>注解并配置<code>cacheManager</code> Bean：",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "The <code>persistent</code> identifier can then be used on the <code>@Cacheable</code> annotation to identify the cache manager to use (you can have more than one configured).",
      "translation": "此时，可以在 `@Cacheable` 注解上使用 `<code>persistent</code>` 标识符来指定要使用的缓存管理器（您可以配置多个）。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "This chapter describes additional support for caching and <code>@Cacheable</code>.",
      "translation": "本章介绍了对缓存和 `@Cacheable` 的额外支持。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Technically, caching is not part of spring-data, but is implemented directly in the spring core. Most database implementations in the spring-data package can’t support <code>@Cacheable</code>, because it is not possible to store arbitrary data.",
      "translation": "从技术角度来看，缓存并非 Spring Data 的一部分，而是直接在 Spring 核心中实现的。Spring Data 包中的大多数数据库实现无法支持 `@Cacheable`，因为无法存储任意数据。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Once it is set up, you can annotate every method with the <code>@Cacheable</code> annotation to transparently cache it in your couchbase bucket. You can also customize how the key is generated.",
      "translation": "配置完成后，您可以为每个方法添加 `<code>@Cacheable</code>` 注解，从而透明地将其缓存到您的 Couchbase 桶中。您还可以自定义键的生成方式。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Couchbase supports both binary and JSON data, so you can get both out of the same database.",
      "translation": "Couchbase 同时支持二进制和 JSON 数据，因此您可以从同一个数据库中获取这两种格式的数据。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "If you run the method multiple times, you’ll see a set operation happening first, followed by multiple get operations and no sleep time (which fakes the expensive execution). You can store whatever you want, if it is JSON of course you can access it through views and look at it in the Web UI.",
      "translation": "多次运行该方法时，您会先看到一次集合操作，随后是多次获取操作，且没有睡眠时间（这模拟了昂贵的执行过程）。您可以存储任何内容；如果是 JSON 格式，当然可以通过视图访问并在 Web 界面中查看。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Note that to use cache.clear() or cache.invalidate(), the bucket must have a primary key.",
      "translation": "请注意，若要使用 cache.clear() 或 cache.invalidate()，该桶必须具有主键。",
      "count": 1
    },
